# Fixture-pack ignores. The root .gitignore ignores media everywhere and then
# un-ignores fixtures/**, so every media file in here is COMMITTED unless a
# line below says otherwise. Anything over ~50 MB, or reproducible in one
# command from a file that is, stays out: the exact rebuild command for each
# ignored file is in README.md. Nobody should have to guess how to rebuild
# this pack.

# 399 MB, CC BY, fetched with yt-dlp (see README).
interview.mp4

# 33 MB, derived from interview.mp4 by a one-second ffmpeg remux (see README).
sample.mkv

# yt-dlp / ffmpeg scratch that must never be committed even if a download is
# interrupted mid-way.
*.part
*.ytdl
*_raw.*
*.f[0-9]*.mp4
*.f[0-9]*.m4a

# Personal recordings of the repo owner: never published. Record your own
# (README.md says how and what properties to check for).
phone_portrait.mov
screenrec.mov
